# Airtable Database Schema

This document is the canonical reference for the Airtable base backing the inventory management application. It reflects the live schema retrieved on **2025-10-14** from base `appbFRxaDoYTDJl0v` via the Airtable Metadata API.

---

## Table: `Unique_Orders` (`tblyqUnUVOyvQwRAA`)

| Field Name | Type | Notes |
|------------|------|-------|
| Order ID | Auto number | Primary field used as human-readable order reference. |
| Date Ordered | Date/Time (UTC) | Order submission timestamp. |
| Item Category | Single line text | Category selected during ordering. |
| Item Nature | Single line text | Serialised / Non-serialised flag captured from the form. |
| Region | Single line text | Delivery region. |
| Contractor Company | Single line text | Required for technician deliveries. |
| Technician | Single line text | Technician name for technician deliveries. |
| Quantity Ordered | Number | Quantity per line item. |
| Dispatch Status | Single select | Workflow state (`Pending`, `Dispatched`, `Partial`, etc.). |
| Stock Availability | Single select | Inventory availability snapshot. |
| Pick Status | Single select | Picking workflow state. |
| Dispatch Method | Single select | Courier / In-house / Pickup / Other. |
| WayBill Number | Single line text | Courier reference. |
| Ordered by | Single line text | Email captured from the form. |
| On Behalf of | Single line text | Auto-filled from technician email when applicable. |
| PoPID | Single line text | Technician location identifier (string in current base). |
| Deliver to Part | Single line text | Technician / Regional Warehouse / Non Technician. |
| Recipient Name / Company / Address / Contact / Email | Text & Email | Captured for non-technician and warehouse deliveries. |
| Order Location | Single line text | Auto-filled location metadata. |
| Warehouse Fulfilling | Single line text | Assigned warehouse. |
| Attachments | Attachment(s) | Supporting documentation. |
| Order Notes | Long text | Free-form notes. |
| Dispatch Log | Linked records → `Dispatch_Log` | Reverse link field `Order Id`. |
| Stock Order | Linked records → `Stock_Order` | Reverse link field `Related Unique Order`. |
| Order Summary (AI Generated) | AI text | Airtable-generated summary, read-only. |

**Usage**: Each cart submission from the app creates one or more rows in this table (one per item). Operational teams use the additional workflow fields to coordinate picking, dispatch, and fulfillment.

