## Table: `Dispatch_Log` (`tblkDF6kf0gsUWJZk`)

| Field Name | Type | Notes |
|------------|------|-------|
| ID | Auto number | Primary dispatch record identifier. |
| Order Id | Linked record → `Unique_Orders` | Associates the dispatch event with an order line. |
| Date Dispatched | Date | Calendar day goods left the warehouse. |
| Item Category / Nature / Description / Device type | Single line text | Snapshot of dispatched item details. |
| Serial Number fields | Single line text | Tracks cradle, terminal, charger serials where relevant. |
| Quantity | Number | Units dispatched. |
| Region / Contractor Company / Technician | Single line text | Mirrors order routing data. |
| Waybill number | Single line text | Courier reference. |
| Packer / Dispatcher | Single line text | Operational accountability. |
| Dispatch Method | Single select | Courier / In-house / Pickup / Other. |
| Stock Availability / Pick Status | Single line text | Snapshot at dispatch time. |
| Shipped | Single select | Yes / No toggle. |
| Package Reference | Single line text | Parcel identifier. |
| Item Code | Single line text | SKU or internal code. |
| StockOrderID | Single line text | Reference to `Stock_Order` row. |
| Accessory flags (ChargerPacked, Cables, Paper Rolls, etc.) | Single line text | Optional logistics metadata. |
| Location & Action fields | Single line text | Provide audit trail of item movement. |
| TimePicked / TimeDispatched | Date/Time | Timestamps for pick and dispatch. |
| Warehouse Fulfilling | Single line text | Dispatching warehouse. |
| Bill Folder | Attachments | Supporting documents. |
| Stock Order | Linked records → `Stock_Order` | Reverse link `Related Dispatch Log Entry`. |

**Usage**: Populated as warehouse teams fulfill or partially fulfill orders. Not directly written by the React frontend today but important for downstream reporting.

