## Table: `Inventory_Items` (`tbla6U4lTWvBM7yiW`)

| Field Name | Type | Notes |
|------------|------|-------|
| Item_Name | Long text | Display name / SKU description shown in the catalog. |
| Item_Url | Long text | Public S3 image URL. |
| Item_Category | Single select | Source of truth for category filters (Accessories, Cash Connect, VPS, Modems, SIM Management, ABSA, Other). |
| Item_Description | Long text | Extended description displayed in the product card. |
| Item_Nature | Single line text | `Serialised` or `Non-serialised` values consumed by the app. |

**Usage**: Drives the product gallery. Category and nature values are derived from this table—there is no standalone “Business Lines” table in the current base.

