## Table: `Point of Presence` (`tblm1u9gUS4cFCd79`)

| Field Name | Type | Notes |
|------------|------|-------|
| ID | Number | Primary technician identifier. |
| Tech ID | Date/Time | Airtable historical field; not currently consumed. |
| Name & Surname | Long text | Technician full name (note leading whitespace in field name within Airtable). |
| Contractor ID | Date/Time | Legacy field. |
| Mobile | Number | Contact number. |
| Contractor | Long text | Contractor name. |
| Region | Long text | Technician region (e.g., KZN, WC, GP). |
| Area Based | Long text | Detailed location. |
| Physical Address | Long text | Shipping address. |
| Latitude / Longitude | Number | Geo coordinates (integers in this base). |
| Email Address | Long text | Technician email used for “On Behalf of”. |
| Comment fields (Absa, Cash Connect, etc.) | Long text | Additional operational notes. |
| Location Code | Long text | Unique code used as PoPID in the React app. |

**Usage**: Populates contractor, region, technician, and derived contact information when the delivery party is “Technician”.

